From 2222222222222222222222222222222222222222 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] drm/mediatek: Add MediaTek MT6789 display subsystem support

Add display subsystem and MIPI DSI controller support for the MediaTek
MT6789 (Helio G99) SoC.

The MT6789 display controller pipeline consists of:
  OVL0 -> RDMA0 -> COLOR0 -> CCORR0 -> AAL0 -> GAMMA0 -> POSTMASK0 -> DITHER0 -> DSI0
matching the MT8186 pipeline configuration. Add MT6789 match data and
compatible strings across mtk-drm subdrivers (drm_drv, dsi, ovl, rdma,
color, ccorr, aal, gamma), mipi-tx phy driver, and DT bindings.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
---

